      <item>
        <title>1/2 - langgraph 3 - deepagents 4 - langsmith Welcome to the LangChain ecosystem</title>
        <dc:creator>@hwchase17</dc:creator>
        <description><![CDATA[<p>1/2 - langgraph<br>
3 - deepagents<br>
4 - langsmith<br>
<br>
Welcome to the LangChain ecosystem</p>
<hr/>
<blockquote>
<b>akira (@realmcore_)</b>
<p>
<p>Everyone who tries to build a harness from scratch inevitably runs into the same set of problems so heres a list of some:<br>
<br>
1. Good async execution<br>
2. A resource lifecycle manager<br>
3. Agent harness research/design work<br>
4. Evals<br>
5. etc. (it keeps going)<br>
<br>
Just fyi</p>

</p>
