<b>Article</b><br>
<a href="https://nitter.net/i/article/2079976006644072796">
<img src="https://nitter.net/pic/media%2FHN2FFdaWUAANmDF.jpg" style="max-width:250px;" />
<br>
<b>Towards Automating Eval Engineering</b>
</a>
<p>Today we’re releasing our Eval Engineering Skill, a skill that helps coding agents build evals using context from a repository and agent traces.
The skill inspects how an agent is structured, mines</p>


</p>
<footer>
— <cite><a href="https://nitter.net/Vtrivedy10/status/2079976006644072796#m">https://nitter.net/Vtrivedy10/status/2079976006644072796#m</a>
</footer>
</blockquote>]]></description>
        <pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 16:39:42 GMT</pubDate>
